Not to worry, we're pleased to offer you a complimentary upgrade.

99
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,520
Woohoo!

100
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:56,640
Presidential suite, baby!

101
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:58,060
I love listening to this dialogue.

102
