It's just so nice to see that someone is enjoying his upgrade so much.

103
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:11,940
Yeah, especially since he was expecting just a really normal room and now he's going to be treated like a king.

104
00:07:12,540 --> 00:07:15,600
So Marco, have you ever gotten a complimentary upgrade?

105
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,700
Yes, yes, I did.

106
